  "gotchas": [
    "Two shapes: without options, the latest transfers newest first ({ data, count }); with options=1, the countries, currencies and operators the workspace can send to (TransferOptions).",
    "limit is 1 to 200, 50 by default.",
    "Secret key only: a public key gets 401 code unauthorized.",
    "Errors are an HTTP 4xx/5xx status with a JSON body { \"error\": \"<message>\" }. Transfer endpoints add a machine-readable code, and so do some other refusals (code test_mode on payment links, rate_limited on webhook resends). A 401 says Missing API key or Invalid API Key."
  ],
