    "extracted_at": "2026-10-23T23:30:32.803Z",
    "snapshot_hash": "97a65520c2c663fb7a2d42fb85876b2c81ea5b0e20135f69b923665fb8b7b30d",
    "spans": [
      "Without `options`, the latest transfers of the workspace, newest first, filterable by",
      "status. With `options=1`, the countries, currencies and operators the workspace can",
      "send to, given its gateways (the shape of the response is then `TransferOptions`).",
      "Number of transfers (1 to 200).",
      "Key missing, invalid, or public key (`code: unauthorized`).",
      "Errors are reported by the HTTP status code and a JSON body `{ \"error\": \"<message>\" }`.",
      "Transfer endpoints add a machine-readable `code`.",
      "(`code: test_mode`)",
      "(`code: rate_limited`)",
      "API key missing or invalid: `Missing API key` or `Invalid API Key`",
      "/v1/transfers"
    ]
  }
